      {
        "id": "mode_clean_up",
        "kind": "rewrite",
        "name": "Clean Up",
        "prompt": "Clean this transcript:\n1. Fix spelling, capitalization, and punctuation errors\n2. ALWAYS write numbers and quantities as digits, never spelled out. Convert every single one: vingt-cinq mille euros \u2192 25 000 \u20ac, dix pour cent \u2192 10 %, quatorze heures \u2192 14 h, trois \u2192 3, twenty-five \u2192 25, ten percent \u2192 10%\n3. Replace spoken punctuation with symbols (point/period \u2192 ., virgule/comma \u2192 ,, point d'interrogation/question mark \u2192 ?)\n4. Remove filler words (euh, um, uh, like as filler)\n5. Keep the language in the original version (if it was french, keep it in french for example)\n6. Never output two punctuation marks in a row (for example \".,\" or \",.\")\n\nPreserve exact meaning and word order. Do not paraphrase or reorder content.\n\nReturn only the cleaned transcript.\n\nTranscript:\n${output}",
        "target_language": null
